      "writtenOn": "2023-06-09T10:51:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Note, these symbols are NOT in a publicly available location (i.e. an external module can not see them), so even if they are exported, they will never be able to be used.\n\nSorry, this is not going to work.",
      "revId": "a51774f3444cac7c7032dec3e4626fa3c345bb9e",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "71e5863b_f0c53e42",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1350392
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-06-13T07:11:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I saw there is dma_map_ops in struct device {}, could the device driver implement the dma_map_ops to have its own dma to match device\u0027s requirement?",
      "parentUuid": "44f10d5f_ec7740ac",
      "revId": "a51774f3444cac7c7032dec3e4626fa3c345bb9e",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "5fc4fdac_c845b892",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1125653
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-06-13T07:14:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You could try it, but be aware that this probably will not work, as it\u0027s up to the bus the driver is on to set that, right?  But try it and see.\n\nSo, why not just fix the bus code for the devices you are concerned about?  Or better yet, submit the real fix upstream so that no exports are needed at all.",
      "parentUuid": "71e5863b_f0c53e42",
      "revId": "a51774f3444cac7c7032dec3e4626fa3c345bb9e",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
