      "writtenOn": "2023-06-13T08:32:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for reply.\n\nYes, you\u0027re right, it\u0027s USB bus. I\u0027ve tried w/ these symbols and it worked.\n\nI agree that upstream is long term solution as well, but It\u0027s very close to Android14 KMI freeze now, a little bit late to change the design for Android14..",
      "parentUuid": "5fc4fdac_c845b892",
      "revId": "a51774f3444cac7c7032dec3e4626fa3c345bb9e",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
